        "text": "Inference is ~67% of AI compute and per-token prices oscillate >90% within quarters, yet procurement has no way to forward-buy or hedge. Cubit is an OpenAI-compatible gateway that quotes a fixed monthly $/M-tokens against a multi-provider basket, routes across closed + DePIN supply, and pockets the basis.",
