      "props": {
        "text": "Drop-in router across ≥3 providers (frontier closed + commodity + Darkbloom or Surplus Intelligence DePIN), monthly fixed-rate quote against Cubit's basket index, USD or x402 USDC settlement on Base. Reuses the basket / spread / clearinghouse code already in prototypes/compute-futures/.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
